.TH AVR\-SKILL\-STATUS 1 "" "avr 0.2.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-skill-status \- Show whether the bundled Avrea skill is installed and current.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr skill status
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show whether the bundled Avrea skill is installed and current.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-target\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Agent host to inspect. (choices: codex, claude, all; default: all)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-skill (1),
.BR avr-skill-install (1),
.BR avr-skill-uninstall (1),
.BR avr-skill-update (1)
